OL,3,GNEWSAStoke house music DJ voted one of
OL,4,Athe world's best
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm sort of a biggish fish in a small
OL,7,Fpond in my own area," says DJ legend
OL,8,FPete Bromley.
OL,10,FMany customers buying vinyl online from
OL,11,Fa record shop in Stoke-on-Trent may not
OL,12,Frealise they are ordering from someone
OL,13,Fwith a long history in the dance music
OL,14,Fworld.
OL,16,FBromley was recently voted number 17 in
OL,17,Fa top 100 poll of the world's best DJs
OL,18,Frun by the podcast and social media
OL,19,Fsite The Dancefloor Diaries. His name
OL,20,Fis alongside the likes of Carl Cox,
OL,21,FSasha and Graeme Park.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
